  "genie_instructions": "DOMAIN CONTEXT\nThis space supports grid management and energy mix optimization for an electric utility balancing renewable integration, reliability, and cost across multiple zones and regions. Stakeholders include Grid Operations (frequency / congestion / imports), Resource Planning (capacity factor, curtailment, LMP), the T&D VP (SAIDI/SAIFI reliability), and ESG/CFO (renewable share, carbon intensity, fuel mix).\n\nMETRIC DEFINITIONS\n- Generation = generation_mw by fuel_type; renewables = Solar, Wind, Hydro\n- Curtailment = curtailment_mw (instantaneous) / curtailment_mwh (monthly); healthy <5% of renewable output, >10% indicates congestion or oversupply\n- Carbon intensity = carbon_intensity_kg_mwh; <100 mostly clean, 400-800 typical fossil mix\n- Capacity factor = capacity_factor_pct (solar ~20-25%, wind ~35-45%, nuclear ~90%)\n- Renewable share = renewable_share_pct (monthly) or renewable_pct (daily load snapshot)\n- Grid frequency = avg_frequency_hz; target 60.00, deviation >0.05 Hz is a reliability concern\n- SAIDI = saidi_minutes (IEEE 1366 industry median ~120 min/customer/year)\n- SAIFI = saifi_events (industry median ~1.0-1.4 events/customer/year)\n- LMP = avg_lmp_usd_mwh; locational marginal price\n\nQUERY GUIDANCE\n- ALWAYS prefer metric views with MEASURE() syntax for aggregations.\n  - generation_metrics (source: generation_readings) — dims: reading_date, region, fuel_type; measures: total_generation_mw, avg_capacity_factor, total_curtailment_mw, avg_carbon_intensity, reading_count, unique_zone_count, max_generation_mw.\n  - load_metrics (source: load_snapshots) — dims: snapshot_date, region, zone_id; measures: avg_peak_demand_mw, avg_congestion_index, total_import_mw, total_export_mw, avg_renewable_pct, total_avg_frequency_hz, max_peak_demand_mw.\n- Use GROUP BY ALL with MEASURE() queries.\n- For monthly trends, always wrap the date in DATE_TRUNC('month', <date_col>).\n- For \"Top X\" requests, return LIMIT 10 unless the user specifies otherwise.\n- Query base tables directly only when needing columns not exposed by metric views (e.g. zone_name, saidi_minutes, saifi_events, avg_lmp_usd_mwh, total_carbon_tons, renewable_share_pct).\n- When the user's phrasing matches a SQL snippet display name (filters, expressions, or measures), prefer that snippet.",
  "sample_questions": [
    "Show monthly trend of total generation MW by fuel type for the trailing 12 months.",
    "Top 10 zones by total renewable curtailment MW over the last 90 days.",
    "How has average carbon intensity trended month-over-month by region?",
    "Which regions have the highest SAIDI minutes and SAIFI events in the most recent month?",
    "What is the average renewable share by region this year, and how does it compare to last year?",
    "Top 10 zones by congestion index — what is the average LMP for those zones?",
    "Show monthly trend of total carbon emissions tons against renewable share % across the network."
  ],
  "example_sqls": [
    {
      "question": "What is the monthly trend in highest generation mw?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT reading_date, MEASURE(max_generation_mw) AS max_generation_mw",
        "FROM {fqn}.generation_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY reading_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has total generation output in mw changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT reading_date, MEASURE(total_generation_mw) AS total_generation_mw",
        "FROM {fqn}.generation_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY reading_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the monthly trend in total power exported in mw?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT snapshot_date, MEASURE(total_export_mw) AS total_export_mw",
        "FROM {fqn}.load_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY snapshot_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the monthly trend in average renewable share percentage?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT snapshot_date, MEASURE(avg_renewable_pct) AS avg_renewable_pct",
        "FROM {fqn}.load_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY snapshot_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the trend of total curtailed generation in mw (renewable only) over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT reading_date, SUM(curtailment_mw) AS total_curtailment_mw",
        "FROM {fqn}.generation_readings",
        "GROUP BY reading_date ORDER BY reading_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the trend of total peak demand in mw for the day over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT snapshot_date, SUM(peak_demand_mw) AS total_peak_demand_mw",
        "FROM {fqn}.load_snapshots",
        "GROUP BY snapshot_date ORDER BY snapshot_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has the average renewable energy share of total generation changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT report_month, AVG(renewable_share_pct) AS avg_renewable_share_pct",
        "FROM {fqn}.grid_kpi_monthly",
        "GROUP BY report_month ORDER BY report_month"
      ]
    }
  ],
